/**
 * Livsfaser & personlig utveckling → Livets motgångar, 1251–1257 (0.29): disappointment and loss, change and
 * uncertainty, stressful periods, asking for practical help, supporting someone in crisis, recovering after a
 * setback and finding new paths. Almost every word is abstract, so the pictures are calm symbolic scenes: weights
 * and broken hearts for loss, fog and whirlwinds for change, umbrellas and hands for support, plants that rise
 * again and tunnels with light for recovery, doors and paths for new beginnings. Nothing is graphic: death is
 * shown only as a framed photo with a candle. Posed figures (`F`) reach with real arms from the shoulder.
 */
